<title>HONG KONG: Midas in talks to buy units from YGM.</title>
<headline>Midas in talks to buy units from YGM.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printing concern Midas Printing Group Ltd said on Friday it was in negotiations to buy certain subsidiary companies from printing group YGM Trading Ltd.</p>
<p>Midas said &quot;such negotiations are in process but no details have yet been finalised&quot;.</p>
<p>The company said it would issue an announcement once all the details of the proposed purchase was finalsied.</p>
<p>Midas shares fell one cent to HK$0.97 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
